OL,3,GNEWSATown's important future role in
OL,4,Aspace tech - firm
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe opening of a multimillion-pound
OL,7,Fspace test centre in Keighley will help
OL,8,Fthe town "flourish", the boss of the
OL,9,FAmerican tech company behind the plan
OL,10,Fhas said.
OL,12,FBradford Council recently announced the
OL,13,FSpace Test North facility would open in
OL,14,FProvidence Park, supported by a #4.5m
OL,15,Fgrant from the Local Regeneration Fund.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,382,380,200,160,0,100
