OL,3,GNEWSATown's important future role in
OL,4,Aspace tech - firm
OL,5,
OL,6,FRon Ruppersburg, president of US-based
OL,7,FMPG, told a meeting that the test
OL,8,Fcentre, which is expected to provide
OL,9,Fcutting-edge specialist radio frequency
OL,10,Fand environmental testing for space and
OL,11,Fsatellite hardware, would be operated
OL,12,Fby MPG Europe.
OL,14,FIt would establish Keighley as an
OL,15,F"important centre for space and
OL,16,Fadvanced technology development",
OL,17,FRuppersburg said.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
